#. Description of the plugin
#: mandrakecrm.php
msgid "Recover abandoned carts. Email marketing campaigns. Track campaign ROI. Connect your store in minutes. Start free 7-day trial."
msgstr "Recupera carritos abandonados. Campañas de email marketing. Rastrea ROI. Conecta tu tienda en minutos. Prueba gratis 7 días."

